nd reconnect with an old frenemy. But will they all end up on the menu?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mIiTZdsxy7ImmA4SMia5f5XdyTi.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"To Catch a Deathstalker\",\"overview\":\"The chase continues for the old burrow, but first, Kipo and Wolf must keep their cool among the Deathstalkers. Scarlemagne makes a whopping discovery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cGSRMNdBlG73cQeDa0zA2iq1yEw.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Fun Gus (1)\",\"overview\":\"Kipo and company look for answers — and an anchor — in her parents’ old quarters. But are they alone? Above, mysterious forces gather against a ruler.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6aROMmn0NGzPwDai3kK6U49VfN.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Fun Gus (2)\",\"overview\":\"Fun Gus is among us. The chums frolic with the pushy player till a slippery helper arrives. Time to throw Kipo an anchor as the Mega Monkey moves on.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aVpmBeXINbz8OeYucMZHtmk2lWA.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Benson and the Beast\",\"overview\":\"The Mega Jaguar rages out of control, but Benson has a knack for handling rowdy Mutes. Can the gang rely on Dr. Emilia — and Kipo herself?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wIF6Jk1qqVYpWb45UxxNtTZJbEp.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Sympathy for the Mandrill\",\"overview\":\"From Hugo to Scarlemagne, from victim to villain, a tyrant tells his tale. Wolf, Benson and Dave hatch a plan that could blow up in their faces.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDZZ31VXcDSnQSAPJO5j0D2SmxB.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"All That Glitters\",\"overview\":\"Game on. Kipo just won't give up hope when it comes to finding the good beneath the savagery. Can the Brunch Bunch flip the odds with flapjacks?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eA1SKvCARTGFW47fa3YYxg9MO4S.jpg\",\"rating\":9.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Heroes on Fire\",\"overview\":\"With a little help from friends, Kipo breaks the chains of mind control as chaos comes to the coronation. Will she sacrifice it all to save everyone?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2E1nvPR8kH4s2VzMsmE6SMPDK0Y.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-12\",\"runtime\":23}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-01-14\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}